{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログをご覧頂きありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広 島 県 出 身 2 0 歳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "向 井 純 葉 ( む か い い と は ) で す"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thシングルオンラインミート＆グリートありがとうございました　！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobuUaJT9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全日程が終了いたしました。\nみなさんたくさんの愛を本当にありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobxcJ0KS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "貴方がいるから頑張れます、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "伝わってたらいいな。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobc0B3IW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "16thシングルも櫻坂を愛してくださる皆様と櫻坂のために頑張りたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分がこのグループにいる意味を見つけ出したいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いいたします　！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "9月18日15:40から、日向坂46さんの竹内希来里ちゃんと谷口愛季と3人で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "RCC放送「イマナマ！」　さんに出演させていただきます‪ෆ‪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アイドルについて、オーディションについてお話させていただきます⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誰かの背中を押すきっかけになりますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非ご覧ください⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mob7k8MD2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mob2sTd9Z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日、あいりとの動画が櫻坂ちゃんねるで公開されたので見てみてね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またゆっくり話します！♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それではまた"}], "source": "official"}